# examples/

Place reference code patterns here that the AI should imitate when generating PRPs and implementing features.

Suggested structure:
- examples/controller-pattern.php      — preferred controller shape (thin, eager-loaded)
- examples/feature-test.php             — preferred test shape (Feature test with RefreshDatabase)
- examples/blade-card.blade.php         — canonical Blade component using design tokens
- examples/migration-pattern.php        — preferred migration shape

The richer this folder, the better the PRP output.
